           class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-600 p-6 mb-10 rounded-r-xl">
      <p class="font-semibold text-red-900 mb-2">Quick answer</p>
      <p class="text-red-900">
        IRCC has held no Express Entry rounds since October 28, 2026. It paused invitations on November 3 while it recalculates every profile under the new Labour Market Integration factor, a process it said could take up to two weeks, and it has not announced a restart date. The BC PNP's latest draw is still October 29. This week Ottawa also made the rural immigration pilot permanent (November 9) and changed low-wage LMIA rules (November 6).
