        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/10/canada-refocusing-express-entry-on-top-talent-that-drives-economic-growth.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Canada refocusing Express Entry on top talent that drives economic growth (October 16, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry/changes.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Changes to Express Entry, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/mandate/policies-operational-instructions-agreements/ministerial-instructions/express-entry-rounds.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Express Entry rounds of invitations, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/ircc/documents/json/ee_rounds_123_en.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Express Entry rounds data (JSON), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/Immigrate-to-B-C/Invitations-To-Apply" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP Invitations to Apply, WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP news (2026 allocation, August 18, 2026), WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/canada-creates-a-permanent-immigration-pathway-to-help-rural-communities-attract-and-retain-talent0.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Canada creates a permanent immigration pathway to help rural communities attract and retain talent (November 9, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/overview-of-the-rural-community-immigration-program.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Overview of the Rural Community Immigration Program (backgrounder, November 9, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/news/2026/11/government-of-canada-announces-targeted-reforms-to-the-temporary-foreign-worker-program-to-respond-to-labour-market-needs.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Targeted reforms to the Temporary Foreign Worker Program (November 6, 2026), ESDC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/foreign-workers/refusal.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Refusal to process low-wage LMIA applications (CMA unemployment rates), ESDC</a></li>
      </ul>
